# These files are byte-for-byte copies of data/universes/ and data/presets/
# in dgreenberggit/tbc-gear-prio, and that repo's sync_fork_universes.py gate
# compares the two sides as raw bytes. Nothing else in this clone pins line
# endings, so without this the copies commit as whatever the syncing machine's
# checkout happened to hold -- 15 of them were committed CRLF against LF
# sources, and the gate then went red on a pure line-ending diff with no data
# change. Scoped to this directory rather than the repo root: this is a
# fork-local file that every future upstream merge carries, and only these
# copies need the guarantee.
#
# See tbc-gear-prio ticket 399.
* text eol=lf
